    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="140b07e9-aa09-555b-8145-ee2c485767d7" activityNameId="9462ac9a-3509-515e-b563-55b41cc9eaf1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">1-propanol, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: 1-propanol, at plant
The process "1-propanol, at plant, RER" is modelled for the production of propanol from propanal in Europe. . Raw materials, auxilliaries, energy consumptions and emissions are modelled with data from US-production.  Infrastructure and transports are calculated with standard values.;
CAS number: 000071-23-8; 
Formula: C3H8O; 
UUID: 183b303d-d07b-3177-b091-c581e9c4ab20
Production of 1-propanol including materials, energy uses, infrastructure and emissions.
Location: The inventory is modelled for Europe.
Technology: Hydrgenation of propanal
Time period: Time of publications
Production volume: Total production in the world is around 100.000 tons.
Sampling: Literature data 
Extrapolations: Transports are modelled with standard distances.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_183b303d-d07b-3177-b091-c581e9c4ab20.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
